  "excerpt": "В конце сентября в Краснодаре состоялся IV Всероссийский конкурс на лучшее молод е жное научное общество среди медицинских и фармацевтических образовательных организаций, подведомственных Министерству здравоохранения…",
  "body_html": "<p class=\"p\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">В</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"> <span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">конце</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"> <span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">сентября в Краснодаре состоялся IV Всероссийский конкурс на лучшее молод</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">е</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">жное научное общество среди медицинских и фармацевтических образовательных организаций, подведомственных Министерству здравоохранения Российской Федерации.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">Оренбургский государственный медицинский университет представила команда Студенческого научного общества им. Ф.М. Лазаренко</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">: Наталья</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"> <span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">Федосова</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"> (</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">21л-18(НТ)</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">, Глеб </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">Босый </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">21л-18(НТ)</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">Екатерина </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">Сафронова </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">21л-15</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">Конкурс стал площадкой для обмена опытом и успешными практиками в сфере студенческой науки.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">В течение тр</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">е</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">х дней участники представляли деятельность своих научных обществ, демонстрировали реализованные проекты и достижения, решали конкурсные кейсы, а также принимали участие в интеллектуальных «Научных боях».</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">По итогам испытаний </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">команда </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">СНО ОрГМУ </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">удостоилась диплома финалиста</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"> <span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">в номинации «Научный старт»</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #2c2d2e; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"></span></p>",
